  "cli.usage": "Usage: lmps [options] <command> [args]\n\nOptions:\n  --json          machine-readable JSON output\n  --lang <lang>   language (zh-CN or en)\n  --verbose       extra diagnostics on stderr\n  --no-color      accepted for compatibility; output has no ANSI colors\n  --timeout <ms>  per-stage timeout for apply (0 disables; default 30s)\n  --help, -h      show this help\n\nCommands:\n  profile list|show|create|edit|clone|delete|import|export\n  apply <id>  activate a profile transaction (--yes confirms switching)\n  models      list discovered models\n  current     show the active profile\n  snapshot    capture a profile snapshot\n  hardware    probe this machine\n  lang        show or set the language\n  doctor      run environment checks\n  optimize <id>  recommend optimized candidates (--yes saves the head candidate)\n  benchmark <id>  run a bounded benchmark for a profile (--yes stamps validation; 3 samples, 64-token cap by default)\n  benchmark-all <id...>  run bounded benchmarks for several profiles in sequence (cancelable; --yes backfills each validation)\n  hook status|token|rules|enable|disable  manage the local hook (rules, token, switch)\n  proxy status|aliases|enable|disable  manage the virtual-model alias proxy (aliases, switch)\n  --version   (not implemented)",
